              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimwochï lö lenchinö Serupapel, pöytoghinto Yuda, “Lentöy ECHOTYON, ‘Kikïrik ato otimtiman yïm nko ngwïny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyoran pöyunötin, awanyan owesyengwa nyo pö poryot. Oryewan nkarinekwa cho pö poryot cho chutöy angoletinö nko ipikwa tïkwïl. Meghot angoletine, kïpara kegh ipikwa chokonikwa kïmeghö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okoninyi asisoni töpenö ngacharu paytagh, we Serupapel mötworintenyu. Ipöytonenyi ompö owesyo kaynenyan ompöwölo kakïlinyi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
